🇺🇸🇱🇹🇨🇳 US Continues Meddling Along China's Borders

▪️US government's National Endowment for Democracy (NED) continues meddling and undermining nations around the globe including Myanmar right on China's southern border and a key Belt and Road Initiative parter;

▪️US strategy calls for a distant blockade on Chinese energy and raw material imports which is already underway through the US capture of Venezuela and the crippling of West Asian energy exports amid the US war on Iran;

▪️It also calls for overthrowing nations providing land routes to China allowing the circumvention of US maritime blockades;

▪️NED openly celebrates puppets taking US money to divide and destroy their own country of Myanmar as was done in Ukraine, Libya, and Syria among others;

▪️Caution should be used when claiming a US in "retreat" when its meddling worldwide continues along many other vectors than just direct military power;
